      {
        "id": 229859,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-02-25T19:31:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Oh, <em>man</em>, that cover art.  I think this might be my favorite.  I now want that First Appearance Parse promo really, really badly.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I know, right? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I can’t believe I never considered before that Parse might have changed or been rebooted over the course of Sentinel comics. Seeing that cover, she makes a lot more sense as a character now. All this time, I’d been imagining plus-sized programmer Parse doing all this dark, badass stuff!</p>\n<p>Also, a solid ending gag. And how about that Cooltopia national anthem that’s totally canon now? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Lefty is the hero we all deserve.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:04:43.093Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 19745,
        "topic_slug": "episode-135-of-the-letters-page-mystery-comics-vol-2-issue-109",
        "display_username": "KateWalker",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
