        "created_at": "2020-02-25T20:18:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Who’s to say Adam’s parent knew he was reading it?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>My daughter is 5 years old.  A 5-year-old can’t really sneak stuff past their parents, they’re not clever enough and they stink at lying.  It’ll take a couple of years before she’s up to that.</p>",
